# ---------- ingest intermediates (regenerable from reel.webm) ----------
# Whisper extracts and large frame stacks are produced fresh by the ingest
# pipeline. Keeping them out of the repo holds the public site lean.
#
# reel.orig.* is the PRISTINE downloaded original (yt-dlp, ~720p VP9 + source AAC)
# and the source of truth that reel.webm is derived from. Kept LOCAL ONLY: it is
# large and re-downloadable from the reel URL, and committing it would bloat the
# public repo. The derived reel.webm is what ships.
sources/captures/*/reel.orig.*
sources/captures/*/reel.*.tmp.webm
sources/captures/*/reel-audio.txt
sources/captures/*/reel-audio.wav
sources/captures/*/reel-audio.mp3
sources/captures/*/reel-audio.srt
sources/captures/*/reel-audio.vtt
sources/captures/*/reel-audio.tsv
sources/captures/*/reel-audio.json
sources/captures/*/_meta_raw.json
# Frame PNGs are local-only and re-derivable from reel.orig.mkv. The committed
# gallery poster is the much smaller f001.webp (derived from f001.png at ingest).
sources/captures/*/frames/*.png
# Pulled source documents (PDFs/OCR/HTML from public URLs, doc screenshots cropped
# from frames) — local-only working copies, all re-derivable. Records cite the
# canonical public URLs; meta/record notes record the local paths.
sources/captures/*/docs/

# ---------- efta curation ----------
# Full pre-curation pipeline output (156 pages). Kept LOCAL ONLY: the repo is
# public, and the retired NER "PII" pages contain raw scraped identifiers (mostly
# OCR noise, but not worth publishing). It is the input to efta/curate.mjs and is
# recoverable from git history (the efta/findings.json committed before curation)
# plus the external pipeline. See drafts/efta/README.md.
drafts/efta/findings-full.json

# ---------- eating-book illustration intermediates ----------
# fal.ai/Flux generation outputs and prototype crops under drafts/illustrations.
# Kept LOCAL ONLY: large, regenerable from gen.py, and the chosen finals already
# ship under eating/art/. The tooling (.py / .js / .html / .md) stays tracked.
drafts/illustrations/*.png

# ---------- Instagram carousel workspace ----------
# Editorial scratch for the IG post sets (cards.json + card.html + render.mjs +
# rendered out/ PNGs + mascot art). Local-only working area; nothing here is
# published to the site. Regenerable via render.mjs.
drafts/instagram/
